    },
    {
      "id": "redis-status-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 115,
      "y": 168,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "Key: payment:{id}\nType: HSET\n\nFields:\n  payment_id (string)\n  status (string)\n  updated_at (string RFC3339)\n\nTTL: 168h (7 days)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "redis-status-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 153,
      "width": 100,
      "height": 18,
      "text": "Status Store",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "redis-idempotency",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 390,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 120,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "redis-idempotency-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 405,
      "y": 168,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "Key: idempotency:{id}\nType: String (SET NX)\n\nValue: \"1\"\n\nOperation: SET NX\nIf exists → already processed\nIf created → mark complete\n\nTTL: 24h",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "redis-idempotency-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 153,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 18,
      "text": "Idempotency Store",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "redis-connection",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 305,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Connection: redis:6379 / localhost:6379\nPassword: optional (redis_password)\nClient: go-redis v9\n\nOperations:\n- HSET + EXPIRE (pipeline)\n- SET NX\n- SCAN payment:* + HGETALL\n- PUBLISH / SUBSCRIBE (Event Bus)\n\nFallback: if Redis down, consumer continues\nwith optimistic processing (no idempotency)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dynamodb-section",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 280,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dynamodb-section-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "DynamoDB (via Floci)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dynamodb-table",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 535,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 100,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dynamodb-table-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 115,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "Table: payment_history\n\nPartition Key (PK): payment_id (String)\nSort Key (SK): timestamp (String, RFC3339)\n\nAttributes: status, amount, currency, description,\n            processed_at, trace_id\n\nConditionExpression: attribute_not_exists(payment_id)\n                    AND attribute_not_exists(#ts)\n\nAppend-only: each event is a new record\nIdempotent writes via ConditionExpression",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dynamodb-details",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "Endpoint: http://localhost:4566 (Floci) / DynamoDB managed (prod)\nClient: AWS SDK Go v2 (aws-sdk-go-v2)\nSDK Config: LoadDefaultConfig → dynamodb.NewFromConfig\n\nQuery: KeyConditionExpression: \"payment_id = :pid\"\n       ORDER BY timestamp ASC\n\nFloci: floci/floci:latest, STORAGE_MODE=memory\n       Data lost on restart (development only)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "relationship-arrow",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 40,
      "height": 40,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "points": [
        [0, 0],
        [40, 40]
      ],
      "startBinding": null,
      "endBinding": null,
      "startArrowhead": null,
      "endArrowhead": null
    },
    {
      "id": "relationship-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Consistency Model: Eventual Consistency\nRedis (status) may lag behind DynamoDB (history) by seconds\nUI reads from both stores independently",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null
    },
